# Keep shared source and project files under version control:
# .sln, .vcxproj, .vcxproj.filters, shaders and documents.
# Do not ignore *.obj globally: they are also 3D model assets.
# Keep *.mtl, textures, and required third-party *.lib / *.dll files.
# Place compiler-generated .obj files inside the ignored build directories.
